If you want to see **the entire Video Editor project**, you actually want to run `find` **from the Video Editor root**, not from `Header`.

Because `find` searches **downward from where you start**. If you `cd` into `Header`, it can't show you sibling folders like `Video`, `Actions`, `Tests`, etc.

